<http://data.silknow.org/object/de287c82-1278-36cf-b02b-49a34cca11b7>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk bonnet, England, ca. 1820"@en , "Pink silk bonnet with a wide brim and raised crown puffed and slightly drooping. The edges of the brim and the seams in the crown are trimmed with a wide gathered frill of silk.  The uppermost side of the brim and the band are trimmed with bands of gathered tucks through which are threaded narrow whalebone strips. There is a back frill. The bonnet ties are of matching silk gauze with a woven design of bow motifs and striped borders. The brim is stiffened with wire."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0b5751c9-e95b-36d7-919e-add6c4b5e719> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Silk bonnet, England, ca. 1820"@en , "Pink silk bonnet with a wide brim and raised crown puffed and slightly drooping. The edges of the brim and the seams in the crown are trimmed with a wide gathered frill of silk.  The uppermost side of the brim and the band are trimmed with bands of gathered tucks through which are threaded narrow whalebone strips. There is a back frill. The bonnet ties are of matching silk gauze with a woven design of bow motifs and striped borders. The brim is stiffened with wire."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.202-1960" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs>
                <https://collections.vam.ac.uk/item/O357642> .

